# Binary assets must never go through git's text/EOL conversion.
# This repo is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true; if git ever
# misdetects one of these as text it rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout, which
# silently corrupts the file (a PNG mangled this way still serves as
# image/png but no longer decodes in a browser).
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.webp   binary
*.ico    binary
*.pdf    binary
*.ttf    binary
*.otf    binary
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.mp4    binary
*.mov    binary
*.zip    binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks    binary
